# Keys only — no real values. See steering/01-security.md. Copy to .env and fill in locally;
# .env is git-ignored.

# Origin of Dander's local graph-document bridge (`dander graph serve --file ...`), used by
# GraphToolbar's "Open from Dander" / "Save to Dander". Not a secret — a loopback dev URL.
